                                "sense_id": "54117a20-08e8-3f6a-8bdb-d5cbafc476bd",
                                "text": "The main chromosome in E coli^([sic]) is 4.6 million base pairs (4.6 Mbps) in length, ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6c8273e-0873-41d1-a534-01099caade76",
                                "sense_id": "54117a20-08e8-3f6a-8bdb-d5cbafc476bd",
                                "text": "Firstly, the set of mouse EST sequences having no homology to known mouse mRNAs was used (198323 sequences, 75.2 Million base pairs (Mbps))."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f62de166-e8af-446f-94a9-b199238a83fc",
                                "sense_id": "54117a20-08e8-3f6a-8bdb-d5cbafc476bd",
                                "text": "The total size of the C. ellipsoidea chromosomes is supposed to be about 40 mega base pairs (Mbps) (7)."
                            }
                        ]
